  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0\n      - HTTPS connections use TLS1.2+ by default; TLS 1.0 and 1.1 must be enabled explicitly.\n      - Add net10.0 target. Remove net60 target.\n      - Add TrngInfoRandomSource - https://trng.info/\n      - Remove QrngEthzChExternalRandomSource and RandomNumbersInfoExternalRandomSource.\n      - Remove non-functional web URLs for ExternalWebContentSource.\n      0.5.0\n      - IMPORTANT: configuration changes are required for PingStatsSource.\n      - Add net80 target.\n      - Enhance PingStatsSource to save working targets to persistent state.\n      - Enhance PingStatsSource to discover new targets at random.\n      0.4.0\n      - Removed HotBits network source due to retirement of true random source.",
